## 🔌 API Endpoints Summary

### Authentication (`/api/auth`)

- `POST /register` - Register new user
- `POST /login` - User login
- `GET /me` - Get current user
- `POST /logout` - User logout

### Jobs (`/api/jobs`)

- `GET /` - List all jobs (with filters)
- `GET /:id` - Get single job
- `POST /` - Create job (recruiter)
- `PUT /:id` - Update job (recruiter)
- `DELETE /:id` - Delete job (recruiter)
- `POST /:id/save` - Save job (job seeker)
- `DELETE /:id/save` - Unsave job
- `GET /saved` - Get saved jobs

### Applications (`/api/applications`)

- `GET /` - Get user's applications
- `GET /:id` - Get single application
- `POST /` - Submit application
- `PUT /:id/status` - Update application status (recruiter)
- `GET /job/:jobId` - Get applications for a job (recruiter)

### AI Features (`/api/ai`)

- `POST /parse-resume` - Parse resume PDF/DOCX
- `POST /analyze-resume` - Get resume analysis
- `POST /job-recommendations` - Get job recommendations
- `POST /rank-candidates` - Rank candidates for job
- `POST /extract-skills` - Extract skills from text
- `GET /health` - ML service health check

### Notifications (`/api/notifications`)

- `GET /` - Get all notifications
- `GET /unread-count` - Get unread count
- `PATCH /:id/read` - Mark as read
- `PATCH /mark-all-read` - Mark all as read
- `DELETE /:id` - Delete notification
- `DELETE /clear` - Clear all notifications

### Admin (`/api/admin`)

- `GET /stats` - Platform statistics
- `GET /users` - Get all users
- `GET /users/:id` - Get user details
- `PATCH /users/:id/status` - Update user status
- `DELETE /users/:id` - Delete user
- `GET /analytics/users` - User analytics
- `GET /analytics/business-intelligence` - Business intelligence data
- `GET /recruiters/pending` - Pending recruiter approvals
- `PATCH /recruiters/:id/approve` - Approve recruiter
- `PATCH /recruiters/:id/reject` - Reject recruiter

### Billing (`/api/billing`) ✨ NEW

- `GET /plans` - Get all subscription plans (public)
- `GET /subscription` - Get current user subscription
- `POST /subscribe` - Subscribe to a plan
- `POST /cancel` - Cancel subscription at period end
- `POST /webhook` - Payment webhook (Stripe)

### Support (`/api/support`) ✨ NEW

- `POST /tickets` - Create ticket
- `GET /tickets` - Get my tickets
- `GET /tickets/:id` - Get ticket details
- `POST /tickets/:id/messages` - Add message
- `PATCH /tickets/:id/close` - Close ticket
- `GET /admin/tickets` - Get all tickets (admin)
- `GET /admin/tickets/:id` - Get ticket (admin)
- `PATCH /admin/tickets/:id` - Update ticket (admin)
- `POST /admin/tickets/:id/messages` - Add admin message
- `GET /admin/analytics` - Support analytics (admin)

### Users (`/api/users`)

- `GET /profile` - Get user profile
- `PUT /profile` - Update user profile

### Search (`/api/search`)

- `GET /jobs` - Search jobs (with filters)

### Resumes (`/api/resumes`)

- Resume upload and parsing endpoints

